+On OpenWrt, configure the same setting with the UCI option
+`indirect_controller_probe_miss_threshold`. WHM reads
+`IndirectControllerProbeMissThreshold` from the Agent data model. The value is loaded during
+platform configuration, so restart the agent after changing it.
+
 
